
# THAGWIS AI MECHANIC

## Project Description
THAGWIS AI MECHANIC is a website for an automotive workshop that provides AI Vehicle Diagnostics and Automotive Care services. The website was first developed using HTML and later improved using CSS styling.

## Continuity from HTML to CSS
I continued developing my website from Part 1, where I created the five HTML pages. In Part 2, I added CSS styling to improve the website's appearance, layout and usability while keeping the same five-page structure.

## Changes Made Using CSS
- Added an external `style.css` file.
- Improved the header and navigation bar.
- Styled the homepage hero section.
- Added colours, fonts, spacing and backgrounds.
- Improved button and image styling.
- Created a consistent design across all five pages.
- Improved the overall appearance and readability of the website.

## Website Pages
1. Home - `index.html`
2. About Us - `about.html`
3. Services - `services.html`
4. Enquiry - `enquiry.html`
5. Contact - `contact.html`

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- GitHub

## Project Purpose
The purpose of this project is to develop a professional and user-friendly automotive website by building on the HTML structure from Part 1 and improving its design and presentation using CSS in Part 2.

